WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:03.540
A private document: Share › People with access

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.240
Type an address and press Enter

3
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.644
Choose Can view or Can edit

4
00:00:09.644 --> 00:00:20.549
Email them, with a note

5
00:00:20.549 --> 00:00:23.752
Shared and emailed: Alex can open it once signed in

6
00:00:23.752 --> 00:00:29.996
Alex signs in with alex@acme.com: it's under Shared with me

7
00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:37.534
And it opens
